/// from_refs..., to, inner_mode, inner_len, inner_refs..., seen_flag,
/// [seen_multi, seen_len, seen_refs..., seen_goal]] (inner_mode 0 =
/// null, 2 = list; seen_flag 0 = inner never called => output null,
