/// game/GameUpdates.ts scenario: one `game_updates::run_op(kind, args)`
/// call. kind 0 dumps the 24 GameUpdateType (name, value) pairs, 1
/// looks a name up (-1 when absent). Strings cross as `[len, u0, ..]`
